OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife charities warn Mersey
OL,4,Atidal project could damage habitats
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo wildlife charities have warned that
OL,7,Fa proposed tidal power project in
OL,8,FMerseyside could be "highly damaging
OL,9,Ffor the environment".
OL,11,FCheshire Wildlife Trust and The
OL,12,FWildlife Trust for Lancashire,
OL,13,FManchester and North Merseyside said
OL,14,Fplans for a barrage across a 1.5-mile
OL,15,F(2.4km) stretch of the River Mersey
OL,16,Fcould affect habitats and natural flood
OL,17,Fprotection provided by wetlands.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
