OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife charities warn Mersey
OL,4,Atidal project could damage habitats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA preferred location for The Mersey
OL,7,FTidal Power Project was announced by
OL,8,FLiverpool Combined Authority last
OL,9,Fmonth. The trusts have since written an
OL,10,Fopen letter to Liverpool mayor Steve
OL,11,FRotheram calling for an independent
OL,12,Fassessment of the plans.
OL,14,F"There's a real risk that such a
OL,15,Fproject could be highly damaging for
OL,16,Fthe environment, severing a vital link
OL,17,Fthat's been at the heart of our
OL,18,Fcommunities for centuries," the letter
OL,19,Fsaid.
